[gd_scene format=3]
; SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
; Copyright (C) 2026 Charles (opsroller) and Montezuma contributors
; Key art: the twin temple across its basalt-paved plaza at golden hour, looking east toward
; Iztaccihuatl and Popocatepetl. Buildings other than the temple are invented generic forms.
; Output renders/mark-on-plaza.png, 1920x1080 (rendered at 3840x2160 in render_all.tscn).
; Render all stills in one launch (see render_all.tscn):
;   python3 design/keyart/gen/build.py
;   godot --editor --path design/keyart -- --bake-lightmaps=res://stage_studio.tscn,res://stage_plaza.tscn
;   godot --path design/keyart --write-movie /tmp/keyart/all.png --fixed-fps 1 --quit-after 16
;   python3 design/keyart/gen/finish.py /tmp/keyart/all00000015.png


